 &gt;Testcontainers for Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="link" href="https://sre.google/sre-book/testing-reliability/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
 &gt;Google SRE Book: Testing Reliability&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>